, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.9541569541569541}], [{"text": "Text 2\u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.0947940947940948, "x1": 0.24945054945054945, "y1": 0.10644910644910645}, {"text": "Burning the Old Year by Naomi Shihab Nye", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.6582417582417582, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "Letters swallow themselves in seconds.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.19036519036519037, "x1": 0.6582417582417582, "y1": 0.20202020202020202}, {"text": "Notes friends tied to the doorknob,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.20901320901320902, "x1": 0.6153846153846154, "y1": 0.222999222999223}, {"text": "transparent scarlet paper,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.22843822843822845, "x1": 0.5241758241758242, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "sizzle like moth wings,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.24708624708624707, "x1": 0.5054945054945055, "y1": 0.26262626262626265}, {"text": "marry the air.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.2665112665112665, "x1": 0.4153846153846154, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "So much of any year is flammable,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.3045843045843046, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.3201243201243201}, {"text": "lists of vegetables, partial poems.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.32400932400932403, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.33877233877233875}, {"text": "Orange swirling flame of days,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.34265734265734266, "x1": 0.5802197802197803, "y1": 0.3581973581973582}, {"text": "so little is a stone.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.3620823620823621, "x1": 0.45714285714285713, "y1": 0.37373737373737376}, {"text": "Where there was something and suddenly isn\u2019t,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.40015540015540013, "x1": 0.734065934065934, "y1": 0.4156954156954157}, {"text": "an absence shouts, celebrates, leaves a space.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.4195804195804196, "x1": 0.7131868131868132, "y1": 0.43434343434343436}, {"text": "I begin again with the smallest numbers.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.4382284382284382, "x1": 0.6681318681318681, "y1": 0.45376845376845376}, {"text": "Quick dance, shuffle of losses and leaves,", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.47707847707847706, "x1": 0.6813186813186813, "y1": 0.49184149184149184}, {"text": "only the things I didn\u2019t do", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.49572649572649574, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.5112665112665112}, {"text": "crackle after the blazing dies.", "x0": 0.29010989010989013, "y0": 0.5151515151515151, "x1": 0.5637362637362637, "y1": 0.5306915306915307}], [{"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Non-Fiction Extract", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.08780108780108781, "x1": 0.3956043956043956, "y1": 0.09945609945609946}, {"text": "From Imaginary Homelands by Salman Rushdie", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.13131313131313133, "x1": 0.6021978021978022, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "An old photograph in a cheap frame hangs on a wall of the room where I work. It\u2019s", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.17249417249417248, "x1": 0.8989010989010989, "y1": 0.1857031857031857}, {"text": "a picture dating from 1946 of a house into which, at the time of its taking, I had not", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.19658119658119658, "x1": 0.8945054945054945, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "yet been born. The house is rather peculiar \u2014 a three-storeyed gabled affair with", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.21445221445221446, "x1": 0.8714285714285714, "y1": 0.23776223776223776}, {"text": "tiled roofs and round towers in two corners, each wearing a pointy tiled hat. \u2018The", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.24553224553224554, "x1": 0.8758241758241758, "y1": 0.25874125874125875}, {"text": "past is a foreign country\u2019; goes the famous opening sentence of L. P. Hartley\u2019s", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.8538461538461538, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "novel The Go-Between, \u2018they do things differently there.\u2019 But the photograph tells", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.29526029526029524, "x1": 0.8846153846153846, "y1": 0.3084693084693085}, {"text": "me to invert this idea; it reminds me that it\u2019s my present that is foreign, and that the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.31934731934731936, "x1": 0.8956043956043956, "y1": 0.33255633255633255}, {"text": "past is home, albeit a lost home in a lost city in the mists of lost time.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3411033411033411, "x1": 0.7758241758241758, "y1": 0.3605283605283605}, {"text": "A few years ago I revisited Bombay, which is my lost city, after an absence of", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.39316239316239315, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.4063714063714064}, {"text": "something like half my life. Shortly after arriving, acting on an impulse, I opened", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.41802641802641805, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.43123543123543123}, {"text": "the telephone directory and looked for my father\u2019s name. And, amazingly, there it", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4421134421134421, "x1": 0.8846153846153846, "y1": 0.4553224553224553}, {"text": "was; his name, our old addr the unchanged telephone number, as if we had", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.466977466977467, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.4801864801864802}, {"text": "never gone away to the unmentionable country across the border. It was an eerie", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4926184926184926, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.5050505050505051}, {"text": "discovery. I felt as if I were being claimed, or informed that the facts of my", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.508935508935509, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.5337995337995338}, {"text": "faraway life were illusions, and that this continuity was the reality. Then I went to", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5407925407925408, "x1": 0.8824175824175824, "y1": 0.554001554001554}, {"text": "visit the house in the photograph and stood outside it, neither daring nor wishing to", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.8967032967032967, "y1": 0.578088578088578}, {"text": "announce myself to its new owners. (I didn\u2019t want to see how ruined the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5897435897435898, "x1": 0.8604395604395605, "y1": 0.602952602952603}, {"text": "interior.) I was overwhelmed. The photograph had naturally been taken in black and", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6153846153846154, "x1": 0.9010989010989011, "y1": 0.6278166278166278}, {"text": "white; and my memory, feeding on such images as this, had begun to see my", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6386946386946387, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.6519036519036518}, {"text": "childhood in the same way, monochromatically. The colours of my history had", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6635586635586636, "x1": 0.8615384615384616, "y1": 0.6767676767676768}, {"text": "seeped out of my mind\u2019s eye; now my other two eyes were assaulted by colours, by", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6884226884226884, "x1": 0.9, "y1": 0.7016317016317016}, {"text": "the vividness of the red tiles, the yellow-edged green of cactus-leaves, the brilliance", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7125097125097125, "x1": 0.8989010989010989, "y1": 0.7257187257187258}, {"text": "of bougainvillaea creeper. It is probably not too romantic to say that that was when", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7373737373737373, "x1": 0.8912087912087913, "y1": 0.7505827505827506}, {"text": "my novel Midnight's Children was really born; when I realized how much I wanted", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7622377622377622, "x1": 0.8989010989010989, "y1": 0.7746697746697747}, {"text": "to restore the past to myself, not in the faded greys of old family-album snapshots,", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7863247863247863, "x1": 0.8857142857142857, "y1": 0.7995337995337995}, {"text": "but whole, in CinemaScope and glorious Technicolor.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.8041958041958042, "x1": 0.643956043956044, "y1": 0.8290598290598291}, {"text": "Text 3 continues on page 5", "x0": 0.38571428571428573, "y0": 0.9052059052059052, "x1": 0.6120879120879121, "y1": 0.9184149184149184}, {"text": "-4-", "x0": 0.4835164835164835, "y0": 0.9448329448329449, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.9541569541569541}], [{"text": "Text 3 (continued)", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.24615384615384617, "y1": 0.10334110334110334}, {"text": "Bombay is a city built by foreigners upon reclaimed land; I, who had been away so", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.13597513597513597, "x1": 0.8934065934065935, "y1": 0.14918414918414918}, {"text": "long that I almost qualified for the title, was gripped by the conviction that I, too,", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.16083916083916083, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.17404817404817405}, {"text": "had a city and a history to reclaim.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.1857031857031857, "x1": 0.4835164835164835, "y1": 0.19813519813519814}, {"text": "It may be that writers in my position, exiles or emigrants or expatriates, are haunted", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2338772338772339, "x1": 0.8978021978021978, "y1": 0.24708624708624707}, {"text": "by some sense of lo:", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.25874125874125875, "x1": 0.35714285714285715, "y1": 0.27195027195027194}, {"text": "s, some urge to reclaim, to look back, even at the risk of being", "x0": 0.37032967032967035, "y0": 0.25874125874125875, "x1": 0.8912087912087913, "y1": 0.27195027195027194}, {"text": "mutated into pillars of salt. But if we do look back, we must also do so in the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2836052836052836, "x1": 0.8395604395604396, "y1": 0.29681429681429683}, {"text": "knowledge \u2014 which gives rise to profound uncertainties \u2014 that our physical", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3076923076923077, "x1": 0.8296703296703297, "y1": 0.3209013209013209}, {"text": "alienation from India almost inevitably means that we will not be capable of", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.3457653457653458}, {"text": "reclaiming precisely the thing that was lost; that we will, in short, create fictions,", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.35742035742035744, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "not actual cities or villages, but invisible ones, imaginary homelands, Indias of the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3815073815073815, "x1": 0.8879120879120879, "y1": 0.3947163947163947}, {"text": "mind.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4063714063714064, "x1": 0.23736263736263735, "y1": 0.41647241647241645}, {"text": "End of Text 3", "x0": 0.44175824175824174, "y0": 0.533022533022533, "x1": 0.5571428571428572, "y1": 0.5431235431235432}], [{"text": "Text 4 \u2014 Prose Fiction Extract", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.07148407148407149, "x1": 0.4076923076923077, "y1": 0.08313908313908314}, {"text": "The Other Side of the World by Stephanie Bishop", "x0": 0.19230769230769232, "y0": 0.12043512043512043, "x1": 0.6065934065934065, "y1": 0.13364413364413363}, {"text": "\u201cAnd your day?\u2019 he asks, wiping his forehead then his mouth with the cloth napkin. The", "x0": 0.19230769230769232, "y0": 0.17793317793317792, "x1": 0.8978021978021978, "y1": 0.19114219114219114}, {"text": "weather is still hot. \u2018How was your day?\u201d", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.20279720279720279, "x1": 0.5208791208791209, "y1": 0.216006216006216}, {"text": "She describes the trees, the midday light on the surface of the river. But it is hard to", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2517482517482518, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.26495726495726496}, {"text": "describe. The day is hard to describe. The silent happy children and the unexpected", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2766122766122766, "x1": 0.8604395604395605, "y1": 0.2898212898212898}, {"text": "plunges into panic: spilled foods, accidents, pains that rise with no outward sign. The", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3006993006993007, "x1": 0.8758241758241758, "y1": 0.3139083139083139}, {"text": "beating of the carpet. It is not coherent, her day, the experience of it is not captured by", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.32556332556332557, "x1": 0.8846153846153846, "y1": 0.33877233877233875}, {"text": "saying what she did. What did she do? \u2018Yes, we went to the river,\u201d she says. On the way", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.34965034965034963, "x1": 0.9, "y1": 0.3628593628593629}, {"text": "home they stopped at the shop to pick up a magazine and the ingredients for dinner. As", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3745143745143745, "x1": 0.8923076923076924, "y1": 0.3877233877233877}, {"text": "they walked home she thought about how she might surprise Henry, how she might", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.40015540015540013, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.4125874125874126}, {"text": "please him with fancy meals, with the recipes she cut out from the Women's Weekly.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4234654234654235, "x1": 0.8703296703296703, "y1": 0.4366744366744367}, {"text": "Potato salad with condensed milk and citrus served in the emptied halves of an orange.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.889010989010989, "y1": 0.46153846153846156}, {"text": "Beef Olives, Chicken Dijon. Sponge Sandwich and Butterscotch Tartlets. \u2018Then we", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4700854700854701, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.4902874902874903}, {"text": "tidied up,\u2019 she says, \u2018and we cooked dinner.\u201d This royal we: a mother and her children.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4972804972804973, "x1": 0.8879120879120879, "y1": 0.5104895104895105}, {"text": "How easy the day seems in summary. How unequal to the event. Like a poem, she", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5221445221445221, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.5353535353535354}, {"text": "thinks. \u2018Fine,\u2019 she says in conclusion. \u2018My day was fine.\u2019 She is tired of these questions.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5462315462315462, "x1": 0.9010989010989011, "y1": 0.5594405594405595}, {"text": "Who did she see today? What did she do? It makes her anxious. As if each day must be", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5710955710955711, "x1": 0.8923076923076924, "y1": 0.5843045843045843}, {"text": "accounted for. As if she were always failing at some task he has set for her.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5959595959595959, "x1": 0.7956043956043956, "y1": 0.6091686091686092}, {"text": "\u2018I\u2019m only trying to help,\u2019 Henry says, scraping at the last of the gravy on his plate.", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.6449106449106449, "x1": 0.8758241758241758, "y1": 0.6581196581196581}, {"text": "\u2018Collins mentioned his wife goes to some Sunday painting group.\u201d", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.6697746697746698, "x1": 0.7472527472527473, "y1": 0.682983682983683}, {"text": "\u201cAnd is that what you think I am \u2014 a weekend hobbyist?\u201d", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.7195027195027195, "x1": 0.6714285714285714, "y1": 0.7319347319347319}, {"text": "\u2018I didn\u2019t mean that.\u2019", "x0": 0.2164835164835165, "y0": 0.7676767676767676, "x1": 0.3747252747252747, "y1": 0.7777777777777778}, {"text": "Text 4 continues on page 7", "x0": 0.38571428571428573, "y0": 0.8787878787878788, "x1": 0.6131868131868132, "y1": 0.891996891996892}], [{"text": "Text 4 (continued)", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.24615384615384617, "y1": 0.10334110334110334}, {"text": "\u2018No, of course not.\u2019 But as she speaks she realises that this is exactly her fear, exactly", "x0": 0.1967032967032967, "y0": 0.1320901320901321, "x1": 0.8824175824175824, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "her doubt. Has she already become this? Her paints and easel are still packed", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.1561771561771562, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.16938616938616938}, {"text": "somewhere in the shed. She keeps a sketchbook in the kitchen drawer. She doesn\u2019t", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.18104118104118105, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.19425019425019424}, {"text": "know what to paint. It is a strange feeling, as if the world has stopped resonating, as if", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.20590520590520592, "x1": 0.8835164835164835, "y1": 0.2191142191142191}, {"text": "she\u2019s lost her feeling for beauty. She tried sketching a tree the other day and it ended up", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.8967032967032967, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "looking like a scarecrow, all gangly arms and scruff. \u2018Never mind,\u2019 she says.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.25485625485625485, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.2680652680652681}, {"text": "Later that evening Henry finds her leaning over the kitchen sink and weeping. She is", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2999222999222999, "x1": 0.8714285714285714, "y1": 0.31313131313131315}, {"text": "halfway through the washing-up, the children asleep. \u2018What\u2019s this?\u201d he asks, placing his", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.32400932400932403, "x1": 0.8989010989010989, "y1": 0.3372183372183372}, {"text": "hands softly on her waist. \u2018What happened?\u201d", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.5483516483516484, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "End of Text 4", "x0": 0.44175824175824174, "y0": 0.5275835275835276, "x1": 0.5571428571428572, "y1": 0.5376845376845377}], [{"text": "Text 5 \u2014 Autobiography Extract", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.08780108780108781, "x1": 0.42747252747252745, "y1": 0.10256410256410256}, {"text": "No Friend but the Mountains by Behrouz Boochani", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.13675213675213677, "x1": 0.6252747252747253, "y1": 0.14996114996114995}, {"text": "Under moonlight", "x0": 0.26373626373626374, "y0": 0.19347319347319347, "x1": 0.4, "y1": 0.20590520590520592}, {"text": "An unknown route", "x0": 0.26153846153846155, "y0": 0.21833721833721834, "x1": 0.4087912087912088, "y1": 0.22766122766122765}, {"text": "A sky the colour of intense anxiety.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.23931623931623933, "x1": 0.5406593406593406, "y1": 0.25874125874125875}, {"text": "Two trucks carry restless passengers down a winding, rocky labyrinth. They speed", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.2913752913752914, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.3045843045843046}, {"text": "along a road surrounded by jungle, the exhausts emitting frightening roars. Black cloth", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.889010989010989, "y1": 0.32867132867132864}, {"text": "is wrapped around the vehicles, so we can only see the stars above. Women and men sit", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.34032634032634035, "x1": 0.8967032967032967, "y1": 0.35353535353535354}, {"text": "beside each other, their children on their laps ... we look up at a sky the colour of", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3651903651903652, "x1": 0.8483516483516483, "y1": 0.37839937839937837}, {"text": "intense anxiety. Every so often someone slightly adjusts their position on the truck\u2019s", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.38927738927738925, "x1": 0.8692307692307693, "y1": 0.4024864024864025}, {"text": "wooden floor to allow the blood to circulate through tired muscles. Worn out from", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.41414141414141414, "x1": 0.8538461538461538, "y1": 0.42735042735042733}, {"text": "sitting, we still need to conserve our strength to cope with the rest of the journey.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.439005439005439, "x1": 0.8417582417582418, "y1": 0.4522144522144522}, {"text": "inst the wooden wall of", "x0": 0.6945054945054945, "y0": 0.48795648795648794, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.49805749805749805}, {"text": "For six hours I have sat without moving, leaning my back", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4887334887334887, "x1": 0.654945054945055, "y1": 0.5011655011655012}, {"text": "the truck, listening to an old fool complain at the smugglers, profanities s", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5128205128205128, "x1": 0.7758241758241758, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "eaming from", "x0": 0.7923076923076923, "y0": 0.5128205128205128, "x1": 0.8956043956043956, "y1": 0.526029526029526}, {"text": "his toothless mouth. Three months of wandering hungry in Indonesia have driven us to", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5369075369075369, "x1": 0.889010989010989, "y1": 0.5501165501165501}, {"text": "this misery, but at least we are leaving on this road through the jungle, a road that will", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5586635586635587, "x1": 0.8824175824175824, "y1": 0.578088578088578}, {"text": "reach the ocean.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5866355866355867, "x1": 0.31978021978021975, "y1": 0.5959595959595959}, {"text": "... Many women hold their children in their arms as they contemplate the dangerous trip", "x0": 0.19230769230769232, "y0": 0.6355866355866356, "x1": 0.9021978021978022, "y1": 0.6487956487956488}, {"text": "by sea. The children bounce up and down, startling as we jolt over dips and peaks in the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6596736596736597, "x1": 0.8978021978021978, "y1": 0.6728826728826729}, {"text": "road. Even the young sense the danger. You can tell by the tone of their yelps.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6845376845376845, "x1": 0.8186813186813187, "y1": 0.6977466977466977}, {"text": "The roar of the truck", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.7342657342657343, "x1": 0.42967032967032964, "y1": 0.7466977466977467}, {"text": "The dictates of the exhaust", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.7583527583527584, "x1": 0.47692307692307695, "y1": 0.7715617715617715}, {"text": "Fear and anxiety", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.7832167832167832, "x1": 0.3989010989010989, "y1": 0.7956487956487956}, {"text": "The driver orders us to remain seated.", "x0": 0.26263736263736265, "y0": 0.8080808080808081, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.8174048174048174}, {"text": "Text 5 continues on page 9", "x0": 0.38571428571428573, "y0": 0.8811188811188811, "x1": 0.6131868131868132, "y1": 0.8943278943278943}], [{"text": "Text 5 (continued)", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.24615384615384617, "y1": 0.10334110334110334}, {"text": "A thin man with a dark weather-beaten appearance stands near the door, regularly", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.16083916083916083, "x1": 0.8483516483516483, "y1": 0.17404817404817405}, {"text": "gesturing for silence. But in the vehicle the air is full of the cries of children, the sound", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.18492618492618493, "x1": 0.8901098901098901, "y1": 0.19813519813519814}, {"text": "of mothers trying to hush them, and the frightening roar of the truck\u2019s screaming", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2097902097902098, "x1": 0.8395604395604396, "y1": 0.222999222999223}, {"text": "exhaust.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.23465423465423466, "x1": 0.256043956043956, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "The looming shadow of fear sharpens our instincts. The branches of trees above us", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.2836052836052836, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.29681429681429683}, {"text": "sometimes cover the sky, sometimes reveal it, as we speed past. I am not sure exactly", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3076923076923077, "x1": 0.8769230769230769, "y1": 0.3209013209013209}, {"text": "which route we are taking but I guess that the boat we are supposed to board for", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.3457653457653458}, {"text": "Australia is on a distant shore in southern Indonesia, somewhere near Jakarta.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.35742035742035744, "x1": 0.8153846153846154, "y1": 0.3690753690753691}, {"text": "End of Text 5", "x0": 0.44175824175824174, "y0": 0.5042735042735043, "x1": 0.5571428571428572, "y1": 0.5143745143745144}, {"text": "-9-", "x0": 0.4835164835164835, "y0": 0.9448329448329449, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.9541569541569541}], [{"text": "Section II", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.07148407148407149, "x1": 0.19230769230769232, "y1": 0.08391608391608392}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Section II are:", "x0": 0.0956043956043956, "y0": 0.11655011655011654, "x1": 0.4043956043956044, "y1": 0.12975912975912976}, {"text": "+ Prose Fiction \u2014", "x0": 0.1879120879120879, "y0": 0.14063714063714064, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.16083916083916083}, {"text": "Anthony Doerr, All the Light We Cannot See", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.1445221445221445, "x1": 0.7417582417582418, "y1": 0.15695415695415696}, {"text": "Amanda Lohrey, Vertigo", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.16783216783216784, "x1": 0.5802197802197803, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "George Orwell, Nineteen Eighty-Four", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.19114219114219114, "x1": 0.6857142857142857, "y1": 0.20357420357420358}, {"text": "Favel Parrett, Past the Shallows", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.21367521367521367, "x1": 0.6362637362637362, "y1": 0.22533022533022534}, {"text": "Rosemary Dobson, Rosemary Dobson Collected", "x0": 0.3802197802197802, "y0": 0.24708624708624707, "x1": 0.7692307692307693, "y1": 0.2602952602952603}, {"text": "+ Poetry -", "x0": 0.1879120879120879, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.2602952602952603}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.589010989010989, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "* Young Girl at a Window", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.29448329448329447, "x1": 0.6, "y1": 0.3076923076923077}, {"text": "* Over the Hill", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.31157731157731156, "x1": 0.5087912087912088, "y1": 0.3209013209013209}, {"text": "* Summer's End", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.3278943278943279, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.3372183372183372}, {"text": "* The Conversation", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.3442113442113442, "x1": 0.545054945054945, "y1": 0.3543123543123543}, {"text": "* Cock Crow", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.3613053613053613, "x1": 0.49230769230769234, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "* Amy Caroline", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.37839937839937837, "x1": 0.5131868131868131, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "* Canberra Morning", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.3947163947163947, "x1": 0.554945054945055, "y1": 0.40714840714840717}, {"text": "Kenneth Slessor, Selected Poems", "x0": 0.3791208791208791, "y0": 0.42735042735042733, "x1": 0.6450549450549451, "y1": 0.439005439005439}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.45143745143745145, "x1": 0.5901098901098901, "y1": 0.46386946386946387}, {"text": "Wild Grrapes", "x0": 0.4032967032967033, "y0": 0.4755244755244755, "x1": 0.5043956043956044, "y1": 0.48795648795648794}, {"text": "Gulliver", "x0": 0.4021978021978022, "y0": 0.49184149184149184, "x1": 0.46813186813186813, "y1": 0.5011655011655012}, {"text": "Out of Time", "x0": 0.4021978021978022, "y0": 0.5081585081585082, "x1": 0.4978021978021978, "y1": 0.5205905205905206}, {"text": "Vesper-Song of the Reverend Samuel Marsden", "x0": 0.4032967032967033, "y0": 0.5244755244755245, "x1": 0.778021978021978, "y1": 0.5376845376845377}, {"text": "William Street", "x0": 0.4032967032967033, "y0": 0.5415695415695416, "x1": 0.5175824175824176, "y1": 0.5508935508935509}, {"text": "Beach Burial", "x0": 0.4021978021978022, "y0": 0.5578865578865578, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.567987567987568}, {"text": "Jane Harrison, Rainbow's End, from Vivienne Cleven et", "x0": 0.378021978021978, "y0": 0.5912975912975913, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.602952602952603}, {"text": "+ Drama"